                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="16112642" author="vozerov" created="Thu, 3 Aug 2017 12:26:08 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Possible causes:&lt;br/&gt;
1) Missing co-location (if applicable)&lt;br/&gt;
2) Missing &quot;distributedJoins=true&quot;&lt;br/&gt;
3) PRIMARY_SYNC mode&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16112918" author="tledkov-gridgain" created="Thu, 3 Aug 2017 15:21:29 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Root cause: &lt;tt&gt;CacheTypeMetadata&lt;/tt&gt; was replaced with &lt;tt&gt;QueryEntity&lt;/tt&gt; but QueryEntity doesn&apos;t contain information about affinity keys collocation.&lt;br/&gt;
Fix: set &lt;tt&gt;CacheKeyConfiguration&lt;/tt&gt; explicitly.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
